  "details": "I previously opened a bug report saying that Group instances had disappeared from the instance creation type list, since that’s where they’ve historically lived. I hadn’t realized they’d been moved under the new “Who is hosting” section, and nothing in the UI pointed this out. This was mentioned in the discord as well.\n\nI think a one-time prompt or hint explaining the change would help long-time players who still think of Group as an instance type. They go to that list expecting to find it and end up confused when it’s missing. This addition makes it less jarring for them.\n\nSomething along the lines of: “Looking to create a Group instance? Change who is hosting.”",
